"""art-in/<id>/pixellab.json for the heroes not generated yet, from one table.

    python -X utf8 bone-motion/engine/make_configs.py            write the missing files (never overwrites an existing one)
    python -X utf8 bone-motion/engine/make_configs.py --force    rewrite all of them

Everything here was read off the 256x256 base-pose drawings by eye on 2026-11-19: what the hero looks like, where the two
ends of the weapon are in each view (+-2 px; an end hidden behind the body is a guess), and which cloth should move.
The clip wording is per type: one sentence per clip, in frames, because the model follows frame numbers.
Rules that cost generations when broken (PIXELLAB-WORKFLOW.md, checklist): no face words outside `face`; every clip the
hero uses must have its sentence; the weapon length is the drawing's, never the bone's.
"""
